    Fused kernel that outputs `D0` and `D1`.
    We assume that B0/B1 have the same shape/layout

```
D0 = epilogue0(X @ B0, C0)
D1 = epilogue1(X @ B1, C1)
D2 = element_wise(D0, D1)
```
